  "details": "**Suggestion**\nAdd system to let players socialize with strangers, by matchmaking them into a random world hop.\n**Example**\n- Press \"Matchmake\" in the menu\n- You're in a world with 7 other players\n- The world changes every 10 minutes\n- After time is up, you may stay with the group & travel to a random new world\n- Alternatively, stay in the world, or search for a new group.\n**Why?**\nPublic worlds can be intimidating or toxic. But players have an interest in socializing. A structured way to meet new players may be beneficial for new & veteran players alike.",
